OL,3,ASteering failure preceded New Orleans
OL,4,Acruise ship collision, says NTSB
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tanker that struck a cruise ship
OL,7,Fdocked in New Orleans on Friday had a
OL,8,Fsteering failure, officials said,
OL,9,Fciting preliminary findings into the
OL,10,Fcollision.
OL,12,FIt remains unclear what caused the
OL,13,F"steering casualty" on the Atlantic
OL,14,FAsphalt cargo vessel, the National
OL,15,FTransportation Safety Board (NTSB) said
OL,16,Fin a media briefing on Sunday.
OL,18,FThe collision left 32 people from the
OL,19,Fstricken American Heritage riverboat in
OL,20,Fhospital with non-critical injuries,
OL,21,Fbut no-one was unaccounted for.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
