OL,3,ASteering failure preceded New Orleans
OL,4,Acruise ship collision, says NTSB
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe NTSB said there are many different
OL,7,Fthings that could be classified as a
OL,8,Fsteering casualty, and they are
OL,9,F"looking at all of them".
